WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.850
Some things I've built.

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.510
Some I've led.

3
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:05.210
At The Possible Zone,

4
00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:06.920
a workforce-development organization

5
00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.390
and youth business
incubator in Boston,

6
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:11.710
I was Chief Innovation Officer.

7
00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:15.470
I led technology,
product, and AI strategy.

8
00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:17.160
NeuRace.

9
00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:19.920
I built the sensor
hardware and the software,

10
00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:23.390
then ran it as a service with
professional Grand Prix teams.

11
00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:27.120
The driver's brain and body signals,
next to the car's telemetry,

12
00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:30.590
so a team could see how a
driver responded on track.

13
00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.450
BrightStory is a startup I co-founded.

14
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:37.400
It makes personalized visual stories
that help neurodivergent kids,

15
00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:40.710
and their families, get ready
for something unfamiliar.

16
00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:45.010
Bravely is close to that, for children
with cancer and their families.

17
00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:47.550
It helps them understand
what to expect.

18
00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:49.960
ZoneSight looks for
behavioral evidence

19
00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:52.130
of skills that are hard to measure.

20
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.990
We published it at
IEEE EDUCON in 2025.

21
00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:57.910
And Safar.

22
00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:00.920
Interactive stories for
workplace learning teams,

23
00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:04.710
so people practice hard decisions,
instead of just reading about them.

24
00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:08.450
If you've got something that needs
building, reach out through the site.
